      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i’m just standing in the middle of the crowd at the station and it hits me... like i could literally just stop existing right there and the flow of people wouldnt even stutter. no one would even look up. it feels like i'm already invisible, just a ghost moving through the city.",
